    oe:questionText "What is the recommended first-line pharmacological treatment for Deep Vein Thrombosis?"^^xsd:string ;
    oe:answerText "Apixaban and rivaroxaban are the oral anticoagulants most frequently used to treat acute venous thromboembolism. However, uncertainty remains about the difference in bleeding risk between the two medications."^^xsd:string ;
